      "description": "Participation Act - Working at Utrecht University - Utrecht University Skip to main content Menu Search uu.nl Search scope Subject Staff member Search Select language Nederlands nl Breadcrumb UU.nl Organisation Working at Utrecht University Jobs Participation Act Working at Utrecht University Working at Utrecht University Working at Utrecht University Jobs Open submenu + Participation Act Privacy statement for job applicants Contact Terms of employment Open submenu + Remuneration, insurance, reimbursement Work-life balance Sports and culture Professional development Open submenu + HR excellence in research Leadership International staff and guests UU home Working at Utrecht University Jobs Participation Act Privacy statement for job applicants Contact Terms of employment Professional development Leadership International staff and guests Participation Act Anyone who can work but cannot make it to the labour market without support, is covered by the Participation Act. The law must ensure that more people find work, including those with work-limiting disabilities. Job opportunities We're working hard on the implementation of the Participation Act and regularly offer jobs opportunities. These job opportunities are published at careers.ctalents.nl (in Dutch only). Questions For questions you can contact us online via participatie@uu.nl . Footer menu (EN) Go to Choose a programme Student information Jobs Alumni Giving Services Intranet for employees Course planner My Timetable About UU Contact Directory Disclaimer Privacy Contact Follow UU Facebook Youtube LinkedIn Instagram Utrecht University Heidelberglaan 8 3584 CS Utrecht The Netherlands Tel. +31 (0)30 253 35 50"
